  "body": "Define an invalid filter as one that contains fields that will not be matched according to [the algorithm](https://wicg.github.io/webusb/#match-a-filter). For example, `productId` without a `vendorId`. Throw a TypeError if these are passed to [requestDevice()](https://wicg.github.io/webusb/#dom-usb-requestdevice).",
